proposal for debate: move all ws descriptors, host seams, sessions and half-open supervision below dao.stream; retain board name/table and domain retry in transport-neutral yin composition. Existing handle outcomes remain public contract. Cursor movement used for liveness must be inbound correlated stream protocol progress, never head cursor or raw irrelevant traffic; supervision inside stream, not yin. Explicit driver ticks and finite aggregate work budgets plus inbound/outbound byte bounds required; reject newcomers at session cap rather than evict healthy idlest automatically. UDP must preserve outcomes, correlation, cursor/identity, loss semantics and append ambiguity, not pretend unconditional exactly-once. Wildcard advertises concrete bind if available, otherwise route-selected suitable address via host effect/result; ambiguity or NAT requires explicit override, never claim universal zero-config reachability. Add boundary contract before four slices; host byte limits before gate lift. State agree/disagree per D, strongest risks and concrete acceptance criteria. Report <=1800 words, include model and session identity.\\\\n')\nmeta={'prompt':str(p),'stamp':stamp,'fable_session':'642b5698-f626-4028-9068-0704d093d269','deepseek_session':str(uuid.uuid4())}\nmp=Path('collab')/(stamp+'-architect-transport-mob-routing.json');mp.write_text(json.dumps(meta));print(json.dumps(meta))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"{\"prompt\": \"collab/1791304310868-architect-transport-mob-r1.prompt.md\", \"stamp\": \"1791304310868\", \"fable_session\": \"642b5698-f626-4028-9068-0704d093d269\", \"deepseek_session\": \"0ab62ae7-5a5e-4caa-bc7b-7b09455efb3e\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
